1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,988
Question nine. Highlight: a gear-loan system “applies data control” — what is the main purpose?

2
00:00:06,988 --> 00:00:11,916
Useful: data-control aims — accuracy, completeness, authorised use.

3
00:00:11,916 --> 00:00:16,403
Useless: sports-room setting — does not redefine the purpose.

4
00:00:16,403 --> 00:00:21,478
Option A. Add UI steps on purpose to deter loans — not the aim — cut.

5
00:00:21,478 --> 00:00:26,480
Option B. Ensure data are accurate, complete, and authorised — keep.

6
00:00:26,480 --> 00:00:32,143
Option C. Raise screen resolution — display hardware, not data control — cut.

7
00:00:32,143 --> 00:00:36,998
Option D. Raise C P U clock — performance, not data control — cut.

8
00:00:36,998 --> 00:00:44,059
Data control is about accuracy, completeness, and authority — not deterrence or hardware tweaks.

9
00:00:44,059 --> 00:00:46,560
Therefore the correct answer is B.

